    {
      "text": "The cover of 'Digital Documentation of COVID-19 Certificates: Vaccination Status - Technical specifications and implementation guidance', dated 27 August 2021: a dark blue cover with an illustration of a circuit board joining vaccine vials, a syringe, a virus particle, a mobile phone and a laptop, and the WHO logo. Listed among the WHO guidance this kit draws on.",
